From 448bff7c6644c483787e155192b3a19837ee7a22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fffsfsaf <1825116237@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 14:24:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 959/960] downstream: mm: folio refactor and new features for
 6.6.122-velinux-lingqu-dev-dkms

Original commit list:

1. 07728124659e mm:make mapping_evict_folio() the preferred way to evict clean folios
   Author: Matthew Wilcox (Oracle)
   SHA: 07728124659e88464081ba820ee2edd65edaf523

2. 622eac00b780 mm: convert __do_fault() to use a folio
   Author: Matthew Wilcox (Oracle)
   SHA: 622eac00b780d738db91629285fe268f57685a66

3. 14891729d4ea mm: use mapping_evict_folio() in truncate_error_page()
   Author: Matthew Wilcox (Oracle)
   SHA: 14891729d4ea62a1d3d8b6a93580da2aa015d87c

4. abcbc0e9885d mm: convert soft_offline_in_use_page() to use a folio
   Author: Matthew Wilcox (Oracle)
   SHA: abcbc0e9885d6d9169e68f0038f867a9cba03839

5. 9cee804dd829 mm: convert isolate_page() to mf_isolate_folio()
   Author: Matthew Wilcox (Oracle)
   SHA: 9cee804dd8291cadee9b77dd198a123612514565

6. 1d75cc76f896 mm: remove invalidate_inode_page()
   Author: Matthew Wilcox (Oracle)
   SHA: 1d75cc76f89609dd71a5b3fe97651d45681a7bba

7. 865c11568375 mm: migrate: add isolate_folio_to_list()
   Author: Kefeng Wang
   SHA: 865c1156837594b8732d66787a5bdaa837067ba2

8. 0c9e581672e6 downstream: mm: migrate: add isolate_and_migrate_folios()
   Author: jianzilin2025
   SHA: 0c9e581672e686f4449d270b93410aca3712b5eb

9. 3532d3fbb742 downstream: mm: hugetlb: add get_hugetlb_folio_nodemask() mm: hugetlb: add filter function to dequeue hugetlb functions
   Author: jianzilin2025
   SHA: 3532d3fbb742fbebbeacc67b338e37700d89e406

Conflict resolution notes:
- In include/linux/hugetlb.h and mm/hugetlb.c, the existing
  alloc_hugetlb_folio_vma() on the dkms branch conflicted with
  the newly added get_hugetlb_folio_nodemask() declaration;
  both were kept.
- The alloc_hugetlb_folio_size() / hugetlb_pool_alloc() etc.
  at the end of mm/hugetlb.c are newly added code and were
  preserved in full.

Fix note:
- Removed extra stray closing brace after the
  get_hugetlb_folio_nodemask() inline stub in
  include/linux/hugetlb.h, which would cause a build failure
  when CONFIG_HUGETLB_PAGE is not defined.

Signed-off-by: fffsfsaf <1825116237@qq.com>
Signed-off-by: slim6882 <yangjunshuo@huawei.com>
